Third-party names and assets

Sili Sudoku is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
SudokuPad, SudokuMaker, f-puzzles, or Penpa+. It can import from and export to
their puzzle formats so that puzzles can move between tools.

All names, logos, and trademarks belong to their owners. They appear only to
identify the tool that an import or export action refers to:

- src/features/author/sudokumaker-icon.png: SudokuMaker logo
  (dev.sudokumaker.app).
- src/features/author/sudokupad-icon.png: SudokuPad logo (sudokupad.app).

Third-party software

The build writes the licence notices of the shipped packages to /third-party-notices.txt. The list comes from
package-lock.json, so it is not kept by hand.
